                "metadata": {
                    "note": "Marketplace",
                    "author": "Matthew Bumbach",
                    "category": "stories",
                    "description": "Adventures in the Candy Kingdom was born from bedtime stories shared with my daughters—tales of two curious princesses navigating a world made of sweets while learning real-life lessons. Each story blends imagination with gentle wisdom, teaching kids about friendship, responsibility, empathy, and the joy of creativity. Whether it's managing chores, making friends, or learning to brush their teeth, the Blue Princess and the Yellow Princess model growth through kindness and play. I hope these stories spark laughter, love, and a little bit of magic in every reader’s heart.",
